@title Run card checks on a sized wire: tight corner, hot neighbour (1366x600, the foot of the card)
@area 3D
# A fixture with 35 mm2 wires round the corner of two 25 mm ducts and devices with a power loss.
open qa/fixtures/cable-checks.novo
wait 20
resize 1366 600
wait 10
click_text 3D
wait 40
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text wire runs
wait 4
key Enter
wait 40
click 1120 320
wait 60
shot card-top
click 1296 108
wait 40
shot front-view
scroll 1250 400 -800
wait 10
shot card-foot
expect "Bend radius (model)"
expect "Heat (model)"
